{"channelId":"UC3wCAOfSB0W9iuKDDtNJeGw","row":["Danny Go!",5230000,"Music! Dancing! Learning! Bears! 🤸🏻‍♂️🐻👨🏻‍🔬💃🦹🏾‍♂️\n\n“Danny Go!” is a live-action educational children’s show filled with music, movement and silliness. Created in 2019 by 3 childhood friends in Charlotte, North Carolina, the show inspires learning and off-the-couch exercise for kids ages 3 to 7. \n\nHere’s what you’ll find in our videos: \n +  Catchy, upbeat dance-along songs that kids AND parents can enjoy together\n +  Kindergarten-level learning (math basics, vocabulary, science experiments)\n +  Basic lessons about friendship, kindness & respect\n +  Good-natured silliness and fun\n +  Real-life exploration (i.e. animal shelter, fire station, trampoline park)","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3wCAOfSB0W9iuKDDtNJeGw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3wCAOfSB0W9iuKDDtNJeGw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:01:47.842Z","channelId":"UC3wCAOfSB0W9iuKDDtNJeGw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d92187308a47822b6143ddd53f9dc4919955e2faa2f6e6278030ba09783f88b2","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"8aad18a326c59537884eec054225a63801f379bba55bba99c8542078c0f181df"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3wCAOfSB0W9iuKDDtNJeGw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:00:30.392Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"instagram","url":"https://www.instagram.com/dannygo_official","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":407543,"raw":"407543","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.instagram.com/dannygo_official/","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:10:45.780Z"},{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3wCAOfSB0W9iuKDDtNJeGw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":5230000,"raw":"5.23M subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3wCAOfSB0W9iuKDDtNJeGw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:01:47.842Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"